# Lilypad Village ("{U}, {T}: Surveil 2. Activate only if a Bird, Frog, Otter, or Rat entered the battlefield under your control
# this turn", CR 602.5b): refused after only Moxen entered, then allowed the turn a Frog (turn 1), an Otter (turn 3), a Rat (turn 5)
# and a Bird (turn 7) enters; a creature from an earlier turn does not count, so it is refused again at the start of turn 3.
# Each surveil keeps what it sees, except the last, which puts one Plains into the graveyard.

